5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to pick our next company! I think we should really check how much time we're spending on the operational side of things before we commit to another one. What do you all think?,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,George,,"I agree, Mio. It is wise to be cautious. I believe we should also look closely at the actual stability of the customer bases in our current portfolio to ensure our growth is sustainable.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm with you both, but let's not forget the big picture. We need to be crystal clear about our own financial flexibility before we write another check. We can't just grow; we have to sustain.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I agree! But can we also make sure the new company won't make our end-of-quarter reporting a total nightmare? I want to know exactly how they'll affect our closing process!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with the need for caution. Beyond financial stability, we must examine the actual speed of deployment. I want to know what typically delays the transition from funding to the first active customer.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"That's a great point, Mizuki! Since we're all on the same page about being careful, let's divide the research. I'll take a look at the recruitment and adviser side to see how much bandwidth we actually have!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,George,,"I will take the lead on examining the profile of the exits and the write-off, as well as account retention through price rises. It is essential to know if our success is truly sustainable.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"I'll handle the money side of things. I'm going to look into the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, plus the terms of last winter's credit line. We need to know exactly where we stand.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'll take the reporting side! I'm going to check the appraisal needs at the last audit and the independent checks on holdings' reported figures. Let's make sure the numbers are easy to track!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I will focus on the operational bottlenecks. I'll look into the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings to identify any recurring delays.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,Sounds like a plan! I'll dive into the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats. I can't wait to see what we find!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,George,,That covers all the bases. I will proceed with my research into the exit profiles and account retention. I look forward to seeing how our findings align when we reconvene.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,Perfect. I'll get to work on those reserve accounts and the credit line terms. Let's see if we're actually as flexible as we like to think we are. See you all soon!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm on it! I'll find out all about those audit appraisals and the independent checks. I'm going to make sure we don't get any more scary surprises at the end of the quarter!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will proceed with the security review times and delivery records. It is vital we understand the real-world friction points before we commit. I will report back with my findings shortly.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm all set! I'll get started on my research right away. I'm really curious to see if we have enough help to support a new company without getting overwhelmed. Good luck everyone!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I am also ready. I will focus on the data and return to the group with a clear perspective. Good luck to everyone in your respective research.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,May,,I'm off to crunch some numbers. Let's hope the reality is as pretty as the pitch decks! See you all in the next round.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm going too! I'll be a super-detective and find out all the secrets about those reports! Bye-bye everyone, see you soon!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will begin my investigation now. I intend to uncover the truth behind our deployment timelines to ensure we aren't walking into another avoidable delay. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
